# Operational Hazards (load-bearing)

A message cannot reach a session that starts later. Declare a short-lived condition that other sessions will hit, such as a held port, a saturated resource, or an environmental red gate:

```sh
node "$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/hooks/operational-hazards.mjs" --declare <id> --hazard "<what goes wrong>" --avoid "<what to do>" --until <YYYY-MM-DD>
node "$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/hooks/operational-hazards.mjs" --lift <id> --because "<what resolved it>"
```

`--until` is required. Run `--list` where no hook runs.

Detail: [reference/operational-hazards.md](operational-hazards-reference.mdc).
